  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bilateral development cooperation within the field of peace and security</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bilateralt utvecklingssamarbete inom fred och s&#xe4;kerhet</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FBA:s verksamhet i Afghanistan ska bidra till en fredligare och mer inkluderande samh&#xe4;llsutveckling i landet med fokus p&#xe5; kvinnors deltagande i fredsanstr&#xe4;ngningar och kapacitetsutveckling kopplat till afghansk-ledda dialog- och medlingsprocesser.  I till</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FBA&#x2019;s activities in Afghanistan are to contribute to a more peaceful and inclusive development in the country, with a special focus on women&#x2019;s participation in peace efforts and capacity development related to Afghan-led dialogue and mediation processes.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Folke Bernadotteakademin (FBA) ansvarar tillsammans med Sida f&#xf6;r genomf&#xf6;randet av Sveriges strategi f&#xf6;r utvecklingssamarbete med Afghanistan 2018-2020.  FBA:s arbete ska bidra inkluderande dialog och medlingsprocesser, med s&#xe4;rskilt fokus p&#xe5; kvinnors deltagande.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Together with Sida, the Folke Bernadotte Academy (FBA) is responsible for the implementation of Sweden&apos;s development cooperation strategy with Afghanistan 2018-2020. FBA&apos;s work shall contribute to to participatory dialogue and mediation processes, with a special focus on women&apos;s participation.</narrative>
  </description>
